<title>USA: Acceptance sees 1997 EPS of $2.01.</title>
<headline>Acceptance sees 1997 EPS of $2.01.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acceptance Insurance Cos Inc said it forecasts 1997 net income of $31.2 million, or $2.01 per share.</p>
<p>The company Wednesday reported 1996 net income of $30.3 million, or $1.96 per fully diluted share.</p>
<p>&quot;The company will continue to monitor actual results and will update its 1997 forecast if events indicate that there may be a material change in the forecast,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Acceptance is a property and casualty insurance company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
